---
description: Never add Cursor (or any AI) as a git commit co-author
alwaysApply: true
---

# No AI co-authors on commits

- NEVER add `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, Copilot, Claude, or any AI/agent.
- NEVER add co-author metadata via commit message hooks, trailers, or `-m` extras.
- Commits must be authored only as the human user (Azhartula / local git identity).
- If a tool injects a co-author (Cursor often appends `Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>` on `git commit`), rewrite the commit with `git commit-tree` (clean message, no trailer) before push.
- Verify with: `git log -1 --format=%B | grep -i co-authored` → must find nothing.
